{"id":"1a9a64dce00ebd76","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-compactness.md","title":"Compactness Theorem","display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-compactness","aliases":["92-thm-compactness"],"display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c75bb5270ee96d5a\" href=\"?note=c75bb5270ee96d5a\" title=\"92-df-logical-consequence\">92-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G\\)</span> (structures and satisfaction; assignments are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\">\\(\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\Phi\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\Phi\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>紧致性定理：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>有模型 iff 每个有限子集有模型</li>\n<li>这是完备性定理的直接推论</li>\n<li>应用：非标准模型存在\n<ul>\n<li>先把固定算术签名扩张一个新常元<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，再加入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{c&gt;\\bar n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{c&gt;\\bar n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>；这是扩张语言上的紧致性应用，不是原<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-签名内的字面公式集</li>\n<li>每个有限子集可满足</li>\n<li>由紧致性，存在非标准模型</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>紧致性是模型论的核心工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G$ (structures and satisfaction; assignments are supplied by [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\Phi\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\{c>\\bar n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"8757635b793ed303","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcf794bdb0764404","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]